{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"aminas-first-day-at-school","version":1,"title":"Amina’s First Day at School","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Today was Amina’s first day at school. She put on her new blue and white uniform. Her tummy felt funny, like butterflies were dancing inside.","sentences":["Today was Amina’s first day at school.","She put on her new blue and white uniform.","Her tummy felt funny, like butterflies were dancing inside."],"image":"sha256:c0454b9ecfb95bc27fd64e274dc8d554fa783c0f4afb887a2b31d1c6c3c4eaab","alt":"A girl in a new school uniform stands by a mirror holding her tummy, looking nervous but smiling a little.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:6006487334f28708f0f144e019fda811802ab261d226158ed18660a20b00423f","durationMs":15395,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4354],[4354,9028],[9028,15395]],"words":[[0,531],[531,850],[850,1487],[1487,2018],[2018,2337],[2337,2549],[2549,4354],[4354,4673],[4673,4992],[4992,5204],[5204,5523],[5523,5842],[5842,6267],[6267,6586],[6586,7117],[7117,9028],[9028,9347],[9347,9878],[9878,10303],[10303,11365],[11365,11790],[11790,12958],[12958,13383],[13383,14126],[14126,15395]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Mama held her hand all the way to school. ‘It is okay to feel nervous,’ said Mama. ‘Everybody feels that way on a first day.’","sentences":["Mama held her hand all the way to school.","‘It is okay to feel nervous,’ said Mama.","‘Everybody feels that way on a first day.’"],"image":"sha256:b681fba1f3e2b7eb511b1bdb4a0246e1437fd73214e006b3b0d17547b9d577c1","alt":"Amina walks to school holding her mother’s hand along a sunny road.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:0fd3317f18a96c87feaa5c8b73ab01fb9e85af77920260fd88f08061620acd41","durationMs":12227,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4141],[4141,8474],[8474,12227]],"words":[[0,385],[385,770],[770,1059],[1059,1444],[1444,1733],[1733,2022],[2022,2311],[2311,2504],[2504,4141],[4141,4334],[4334,4527],[4527,4912],[4912,5105],[5105,5490],[5490,6645],[6645,7030],[7030,8474],[8474,9340],[9340,9821],[9821,10206],[10206,10495],[10495,10688],[10688,10881],[10881,11362],[11362,12227]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"At the gate, a bell went ding-dong! Children ran in from every side. Amina’s feet did not want to move. ‘I do not want to go in,’ she whispered.","sentences":["At the gate, a bell went ding-dong!","Children ran in from every side.","Amina’s feet did not want to move.","‘I do not want to go in,’ she whispered."],"image":"sha256:b68250154dec2b6af1510d08efb9eb2529f5d8a163b03a5f88526a9c1731d3cc","alt":"A busy school gate with children running in; Amina stands still holding her backpack straps.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:7fa00a138e07286f5b1f3a48d28e1af81397c300cbf975b9e4b4a53c6e48f70f","durationMs":15587,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4270],[4270,7943],[7943,11617],[11617,15587]],"words":[[0,199],[199,497],[497,1391],[1391,1590],[1590,1987],[1987,2384],[2384,4270],[4270,5064],[5064,5362],[5362,5561],[5561,5958],[5958,6454],[6454,7943],[7943,8539],[8539,8936],[8936,9234],[9234,9532],[9532,9929],[9929,10128],[10128,11617],[11617,11816],[11816,12015],[12015,12313],[12313,12710],[12710,12909],[12909,13108],[13108,13803],[13803,14101],[14101,15587]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"A smiling teacher came to the gate. ‘Good morning, Amina. I am Madam Abena. We have been waiting for you.’ She knelt down so that they were eye to eye.","sentences":["A smiling teacher came to the gate.","‘Good morning, Amina.","I am Madam Abena.","We have been waiting for you.’ She knelt down so that they were eye to eye."],"image":"sha256:300b495071997cb573ac7c74242de37583dafdd7d4d6e220ed23be7d2f4a91b7","alt":"A friendly teacher kneels at the school gate to speak to Amina at her height.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:f50b5583f8eedf2e3d5d12216894203ecb278a3a6adf49476dbaccb475166339","durationMs":14123,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3303],[3303,5945],[5945,8009],[8009,14123]],"words":[[0,165],[165,743],[743,1321],[1321,1651],[1651,1816],[1816,2064],[2064,3303],[3303,3633],[3633,4624],[4624,5945],[5945,6110],[6110,6275],[6275,6688],[6688,8009],[8009,8174],[8174,8504],[8504,8834],[8834,9412],[9412,9660],[9660,10816],[10816,11064],[11064,11477],[11477,11807],[11807,11972],[11972,12302],[12302,12632],[12632,12962],[12962,13210],[13210,13375],[13375,14123]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"In the classroom, Amina sat down next to a boy named Salifu. ‘Do you like crayons?’ he asked. ‘I have a red one, a blue one and a yellow one.’","sentences":["In the classroom, Amina sat down next to a boy named Salifu.","‘Do you like crayons?’ he asked.","‘I have a red one, a blue one and a yellow one.’"],"image":"sha256:b8eb5fce7f4361a6569b9776d452bf3f7ca77d1ec1dde4652b8b8210108eeafa","alt":"Two children sit at a shared desk; the boy holds out three crayons.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:3724e18bed686199b0ff95ab1a6b9c28e995533c0205f8b6fac135f2c152b415","durationMs":13763,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5609],[5609,9554],[9554,13763]],"words":[[0,175],[175,438],[438,1665],[1665,2103],[2103,2366],[2366,2717],[2717,3068],[3068,3243],[3243,3418],[3418,3681],[3681,4119],[4119,5609],[5609,5784],[5784,6047],[6047,6398],[6398,7976],[7976,8151],[8151,9554],[9554,9729],[9729,10080],[10080,10255],[10255,10518],[10518,11219],[11219,11394],[11394,11745],[11745,12008],[12008,12271],[12271,12446],[12446,12972],[12972,13763]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Amina took the yellow crayon and drew a big sun. Salifu drew a tree. Soon the butterflies in her tummy were quiet.","sentences":["Amina took the yellow crayon and drew a big sun.","Salifu drew a tree.","Soon the butterflies in her tummy were quiet."],"image":"sha256:8dacacd7f8c21151fb83d46d65db25f33be7aefd43522c117bf91cc079fdc739","alt":"The two children draw a sun and a tree together on one sheet of paper.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:7b7a132a0a10280d2ef8c57698ceed350a74a2af0a3758bf8b54f0fa2a07220b","durationMs":14627,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6095],[6095,9386],[9386,14627]],"words":[[0,609],[609,1097],[1097,1463],[1463,2194],[2194,2925],[2925,3291],[3291,3779],[3779,4023],[4023,4389],[4389,6095],[6095,6826],[6826,7314],[7314,7558],[7558,9386],[9386,9874],[9874,10240],[10240,11581],[11581,11825],[11825,12191],[12191,12800],[12800,13288],[13288,14627]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"At break time, Amina and Salifu played a clapping game with the other children. Amina laughed so much that she forgot she had been nervous.","sentences":["At break time, Amina and Salifu played a clapping game with the other children.","Amina laughed so much that she forgot she had been nervous."],"image":"sha256:e5f51657fe9fa37faa10de57924be5e1beaaf90eabe76788d21d6f41490b0d75","alt":"A group of children play a clapping game in the school yard, Amina laughing.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:c9d7132dc076c0744d4e4381e91d30b018e68cddb636e5dee0cedc40e259288c","durationMs":13523,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,8115],[8115,13523]],"words":[[0,200],[200,701],[701,1603],[1603,2104],[2104,2405],[2405,3006],[3006,3607],[3607,3807],[3807,4608],[4608,5009],[5009,5410],[5410,5711],[5711,6212],[6212,8115],[8115,8616],[8616,9317],[9317,9517],[9517,9918],[9918,10319],[10319,10620],[10620,11221],[11221,11522],[11522,11823],[11823,12224],[12224,13523]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"When school ended, Mama was waiting at the gate. ‘How was your first day?’ she asked. Amina smiled. ‘I made a friend, and I will go again tomorrow!’ The end.","sentences":["When school ended, Mama was waiting at the gate.","‘How was your first day?’ she asked.","Amina smiled.","‘I made a friend, and I will go again tomorrow!’ The end."],"image":"sha256:3abb082893e8a29123b065f5642ced0e4fb836fe33530f5e42e9e65ea573e091","alt":"Amina runs to her mother at the gate, smiling and waving a drawing.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:959e2a5200e82d986632144ed95a2115a77b6c60aa6e4abb78db1b697de48041","durationMs":16955,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4819],[4819,9103],[9103,11066],[11066,16955]],"words":[[0,357],[357,892],[892,1784],[1784,2141],[2141,2409],[2409,3034],[3034,3212],[3212,3480],[3480,4819],[4819,5087],[5087,5355],[5355,5712],[5712,6158],[6158,7407],[7407,7675],[7675,9103],[9103,9549],[9549,11066],[11066,11244],[11244,11601],[11601,11779],[11779,12761],[12761,13029],[13029,13207],[13207,13564],[13564,13742],[13742,14188],[14188,15884],[15884,16152],[16152,16955]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"amina-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"How did Amina feel at the school gate?","options":["Nervous","Angry","Sleepy"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Her feet did not want to move and she whispered that she did not want to go in."},{"id":"amina-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":6,"question":"What helped Amina feel better?","options":["Drawing and talking with Salifu","Going home","Hiding under the desk"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"amina-seq","type":"sequencing","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Put Amina’s day in order.","items":["Amina put on her uniform.","Madam Abena met Amina at the gate.","Amina and Salifu drew a picture.","Mama met Amina after school."]},{"id":"amina-v","type":"vocabulary","afterPage":4,"word":"nervous","definition":"Feeling a little worried or scared about something new.","distractors":["Feeling very hungry","Feeling very strong"]},{"id":"amina-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":5,"targetSound":"cr","prompt":"Which word starts with cr, like crayon?","options":["crayon","sun","tree","clapping"],"correctIndexes":[0]},{"id":"amina-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"What can you do to help a new child feel welcome at your school?","feelingOptions":["Kind","Brave","Friendly","Caring"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"uniform","definition":"Special clothes that children wear to school.","pages":[1]},{"word":"nervous","definition":"Feeling a little worried about something new.","pages":[2]},{"word":"crayons","definition":"Coloured sticks of wax used for drawing.","pages":[5]},{"word":"classroom","definition":"A room in a school where children learn.","pages":[5]}],"assets":{"sha256:6006487334f28708f0f144e019fda811802ab261d226158ed18660a20b00423f":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/6006487334f2.mp3","bytes":61581,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:c0454b9ecfb95bc27fd64e274dc8d554fa783c0f4afb887a2b31d1c6c3c4eaab":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/aminas-first-day-at-school/page1-1.webp","bytes":73014,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:0fd3317f18a96c87feaa5c8b73ab01fb9e85af77920260fd88f08061620acd41":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/0fd3317f18a9.mp3","bytes":48909,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:b681fba1f3e2b7eb511b1bdb4a0246e1437fd73214e006b3b0d17547b9d577c1":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/aminas-first-day-at-school/page2-1.webp","bytes":79170,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:7fa00a138e07286f5b1f3a48d28e1af81397c300cbf975b9e4b4a53c6e48f70f":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/7fa00a138e07.mp3","bytes":62349,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:b68250154dec2b6af1510d08efb9eb2529f5d8a163b03a5f88526a9c1731d3cc":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/aminas-first-day-at-school/page3-1.webp","bytes":81696,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:f50b5583f8eedf2e3d5d12216894203ecb278a3a6adf49476dbaccb475166339":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/f50b5583f8ee.mp3","bytes":56493,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:300b495071997cb573ac7c74242de37583dafdd7d4d6e220ed23be7d2f4a91b7":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/aminas-first-day-at-school/page4-1.webp","bytes":61638,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:3724e18bed686199b0ff95ab1a6b9c28e995533c0205f8b6fac135f2c152b415":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/3724e18bed68.mp3","bytes":55053,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:b8eb5fce7f4361a6569b9776d452bf3f7ca77d1ec1dde4652b8b8210108eeafa":{"path":"/story-spark-p